<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Hoechst AG.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Hoechst AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    90 DEM		    PREMIUM	16.47 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.11 DEM		  GEARING	7.82 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.JUL.97-18.DEC.98   PAYDATE	24.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FURT, STUTT     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  86.80 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
